<title>USA: St Paul hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady. Top $62.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs    62.00</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs    61.50-62.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs    60.50-61.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs    59.50-60.50</p>
<p>US 2-4     280-290 lbs    58.50-59.50</p>
<p>US 3-4     290-300 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>Sows: steady to 0.50 higher. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-500 lbs   47.50-48.00</p>
<p>	     500-700 lbs   48.00</p>
</text>
